WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:02.314
- I don't usually eat pork.

00:00:02.314 --> 00:00:04.231
Am I going to be eating pork?

00:00:05.101 --> 00:00:07.631
(upbeat music)

00:00:26.509 --> 00:00:27.419
- This looks Asian.

00:00:27.419 --> 00:00:28.859
- Oh, this looks familiar.

00:00:28.859 --> 00:00:30.314
- I think it's meat.

00:00:30.314 --> 00:00:31.409
But these days I feel like you can

00:00:31.409 --> 00:00:32.873
make anything look like meat.

00:00:32.873 --> 00:00:35.373
- I think this is called garb.

00:00:36.539 --> 00:00:39.478
- It looks like some kind of appetizer.

00:00:39.478 --> 00:00:40.358
- Lob!

00:00:40.358 --> 00:00:41.499
- It smells good.

00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:43.718
- Really fresh and kind
of, like, it has a sort of

00:00:43.718 --> 00:00:45.605
like tangy smell to it.

00:00:45.605 --> 00:00:47.519
- Oh it's ground meat, I mean it's kind of

00:00:47.519 --> 00:00:49.899
the color of maybe like turkey or pork.

00:00:49.899 --> 00:00:53.363
- Bite into it and I'm expecting Thai.

00:00:53.363 --> 00:00:55.363
- This is kind of gross.

00:00:58.354 --> 00:01:00.759
- It's spicy, it's sweet, it's tangy,

00:01:00.759 --> 00:01:03.154
it's got peanuts in it.

00:01:03.154 --> 00:01:04.894
I just swallowed a pepper.

00:01:04.894 --> 00:01:06.313
- At the beginning it
was fine but right now

00:01:06.313 --> 00:01:08.396
I was like, I need water.

00:01:11.548 --> 00:01:13.698
- It's a little bit of
spicy but I love it.

00:01:13.698 --> 00:01:16.400
- Are you going to say
I'm eating rat meat?

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:17.914
Because it's delicious.

00:01:17.914 --> 00:01:20.038
- I would guess pork or turkey still

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:21.443
but I know it can't be that because

00:01:21.443 --> 00:01:22.943
that seems boring.

00:01:23.823 --> 00:01:26.589
- What, that's so crazy.

00:01:26.589 --> 00:01:27.479
I want more, to try more.

00:01:27.479 --> 00:01:28.911
- Boiled pig ears?

00:01:28.911 --> 00:01:29.791
It's good.

00:01:29.791 --> 00:01:30.614
Pig ears are good.

00:01:30.614 --> 00:01:32.758
- They must boil it
like really really well.

00:01:32.758 --> 00:01:34.559
Because this tastes like very boiled.

00:01:34.559 --> 00:01:37.278
- Asian people like using
all parts of the animal.

00:01:37.278 --> 00:01:38.653
You waste none of it.

00:01:38.653 --> 00:01:41.379
- I imagine ears tasting
more like cartilage.

00:01:41.379 --> 00:01:43.399
- To be honest I wouldn't have tried this

00:01:43.399 --> 00:01:45.199
if I knew before what it was

00:01:45.199 --> 00:01:48.573
but now after I tried it, it's not bad.

00:01:48.573 --> 00:01:50.906
- It doesn't taste like rat.

